customer: hat_guy
problem: noimages
brief:
	He thinks he is an expert, won't listen, and breaks his own computer: he removed ".exe" from every program in the Windows folder, where Win95 keeps them, so nothing starts. He is grumpy at pickup. A choice there: "Someone removed all the .exe." "Well, I did that." The player can tell him what they think of that.

== drop-off
(neutral) Howdy.
+ Nice hat.
	(happy) Why, thank you. It was my granddad's. Never leave home without it.
+ So, what's your problem?
	(neutral) I click on my pictures, and nothing opens. Not a single one.
	+ Did you change anything?
		(thinking) Well... I did tidy up a bit. Shortened some of those long program names.
	+ Do you get an error?
		(irritated01) Some box pops up saying it can't find something. I just click it away.
	- OK, leave it with me. [end]
		(happy) Much obliged.
